### UC14 buyer applies refund
POST http://localhost:8080/api/order/14001/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"refundMode":"RETURN_REFUND","reason":"质量问题"}

### UC14 seller approves
POST http://localhost:8080/api/order/14001/refund/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### UC14 administrator arbitrates
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/14002/refund/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"remark":"平台仲裁同意"}

### UC14 audit log
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/14002/after-sale-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
